.SS 4. Limits
The limits are constants of the build.
A macro sets each limit, and the library sets each macro that the build
does not set.
\f[CR]cbor::limits\f[R] gives the values.
No call reads a limit at run time, and a check whose limit is not set is
not in the program.
.PP
.TS
